{"text": "million", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Old French, from Italian <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\">milione</i> (\u201cmillion\u201d, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\">mille</i> (\u201cthousand\u201d, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">mille</i>) +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\">-one</i>). Compare <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\">-illion</i>.\n</p>", "pos": []}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u02c8m\u026alj\u0259n/"]]}